    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 20a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">sy he heorðfæst, sy hé folgere—þæt ælc sy on hundre[d] ⁊ on borh gebroht ⁊ gehealde se borh híne ⁊ gelæde to ælcon gerihte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">whether he has an establishment of his own or is in the service of another—everyone shall be brought within a hundred and under surety, and his surety shall hold and bring him to the performance of every legal duty.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si he heorðfæst, si he folgere, þæt ælc si on hundrede ⁊ on borge gebroht, ⁊ gehealde se borh híne ⁊ gelæde to ælcan rihte.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
